368     verbose : bool
369         Flag indicating whether to enable verbose logging.
370     no_execution: bool
371         Run setup but to not call LLM or write any code. For testing purposes.
372 
373     Returns
374     -------
375     None
376     """
377 
378     if debug:
379         import pdb
380 
